START 

SHOW Splash Screen
WAIT 3 seconds
NAVIGATE to Main Screen

MAIN SCREEN:
LOAD arrays (items, categories, quantities, notes)
SET totalItems = 0

FOR each quantity in quantities:
ADD to totalItems

DISPLAY totalItems

IF "View Gear List" clicked:
GO to Detailed Screen

DETAILED SCREEN:
FOR each item in arrays:
DISPLAY item, category, quantity, notes

IF "Back to Base" clicked:
RETURN to Main Screen

END 
